<h2>Reset your password</h2>

<p>Hi <%= @resource.name %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your Netra account. Click the link below to set a new password:</p>

<% frontend_host = ENV.fetch('FRONTEND_HOST', 'localhost:8080') %>
<% tenant = Apartment::Tenant.current %>
<% reset_url = "http://#{tenant}.#{frontend_host}/reset-password?token=#{@token}" %>
<p><a href="<%= reset_url %>">Reset my password</a></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above.</p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %>.</p>

<p>— Netra</p>
